          "src": "audio/fix_story-1.wav",
          "startFrame": 63,
          "durationFrames": 132
        },
        {
          "text": "RegOS reads it, gets the same answer twice over, and stops there. Fifty percent, and a case for a person.",
          "src": "audio/fix_story-2.wav",
          "startFrame": 204,
          "durationFrames": 211
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the same clause with the start date written in. That edit is ours, not SEBI's, and the page says so.",
